{"b":"Prov","c":10,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"The proverbs of Solomon. A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish son is the heaviness of his mother.","it":[[76,78]],"x":[["Prov.1.1",19,"e"],["Prov.17.25",13,"w"],["Prov.29.3",13,"r"],["Prov.29.15",11,"w"],["Prov.23.24",10,"w"],["Prov.23.25",10,"w"],["Prov.23.15",10,"w"],["Prov.23.16",10,"r"],["Prov.15.20",8,"q"],["Prov.17.21",7,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Treasures of wickedness profit nothing: but righteousness delivereth from death.","x":[["Prov.11.4",13,"e"],["Prov.12.28",6,"w"],["Prov.21.6",6,"w"],["Ps.49.6",5,"r"],["Ps.49.10",5,"r"],["Ezek.7.19",4,"r"],["Rom.5.21",4,"w"],["Zeph.1.18",4,"r"],["Luke.16.22",3,"r"],["Luke.16.23",3,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"The LORD will not suffer the soul of the righteous to famish: but he casteth away the substance of the wicked.","x":[["Matt.6.30",14,"r"],["Matt.6.33",14,"r"],["Ps.37.25",13,"w"],["Ps.34.9",12,"r"],["Ps.34.10",12,"w"],["Ps.37.3",12,"r"],["Zeph.1.18",7,"r"],["Ps.37.19",7,"r"],["Ps.33.19",7,"r"],["Job.5.20",6,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"He becometh poor that dealeth with a slack hand: but the hand of the diligent maketh rich.","it":[[30,34]],"x":[["Prov.21.5",12,"w"],["Prov.20.4",11,"r"],["Prov.19.15",10,"r"],["Prov.13.4",10,"w"],["Prov.12.24",7,"w"],["Prov.6.6",7,"r"],["Prov.6.11",7,"r"],["Prov.19.24",6,"r"],["Prov.20.13",6,"r"],["1Cor.15.58",6,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"He that gathereth in summer is a wise son: but he that sleepeth in harvest is a son that causeth shame.","it":[[28,30],[43,46],[75,77]],"x":[["Prov.6.8",6,"w"],["Prov.30.25",4,"w"],["Prov.17.2",3,"e"],["Prov.19.26",3,"w"],["Prov.6.6",2,"w"],["Prov.12.4",2,"r"],["Isa.55.6",1,"r"],["Isa.55.7",1,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"Blessings are upon the head of the just: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.","it":[[10,13]],"x":[["Deut.28.2",9,"w"],["Prov.28.20",6,"w"],["Job.29.13",4,"r"],["Prov.10.11",4,"e"],["Prov.24.25",4,"r"],["Ps.107.42",3,"w"],["Prov.11.26",3,"w"],["Rom.3.19",3,"w"],["2Tim.1.16",3,"r"],["2Tim.1.18",3,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"The memory of the just is blessed: but the name of the wicked shall rot.","x":[["Ps.112.6",20,"r"],["Luke.1.48",14,"w"],["Mark.14.9",8,"r"],["Ps.109.13",7,"r"],["2Chr.24.16",3,"r"],["Job.18.17",2,"r"],["Ps.109.15",2,"w"],["Ps.9.5",2,"w"],["Ps.9.6",2,"r"],["2Kgs.19.34",1,"r"]]},{"n":8,"t":"The wise in heart will receive commandments: but a prating fool shall fall.","x":[["Matt.7.24",7,"w"],["Matt.7.25",7,"r"],["Prov.12.1",4,"r"],["Prov.18.6",3,"w"],["Prov.18.7",3,"w"],["Prov.9.9",3,"w"],["Prov.1.5",3,"w"],["Jas.3.13",3,"w"],["Prov.12.13",2,"r"],["Ps.119.34",2,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"He that walketh uprightly walketh surely: but he that perverteth his ways shall be known.","x":[["Prov.28.18",16,"e"],["Matt.10.26",11,"w"],["Isa.33.15",9,"w"],["Isa.33.16",9,"r"],["Ps.26.11",8,"r"],["Ps.26.12",8,"r"],["1Tim.5.25",7,"r"],["Prov.3.23",4,"r"],["Ps.25.21",4,"r"],["Ps.84.11",4,"w"]]},{"n":10,"t":"He that winketh with the eye causeth sorrow: but a prating fool shall fall.","x":[["Ps.35.19",6,"w"],["Prov.6.13",4,"w"],["Prov.10.8",3,"e"],["3John.1.10",3,"w"],["Prov.18.21",2,"r"],["Job.15.12",2,"r"],["Prov.18.6",2,"w"],["Prov.18.7",2,"w"]]},{"n":11,"t":"The mouth of a righteous man is a well of life: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.","it":[[25,31]],"x":[["Prov.13.14",8,"r"],["Prov.10.6",7,"e"],["Prov.18.4",6,"w"],["Prov.10.20",5,"w"],["Prov.10.21",5,"w"],["Eph.4.29",5,"w"],["Prov.16.22",4,"r"],["Prov.16.24",4,"r"],["Ps.37.30",4,"w"],["Ps.37.31",4,"r"]]},{"n":12,"t":"Hatred stirreth up strifes: but love covereth all sins.","x":[["1Pet.4.8",29,"w"],["Prov.17.9",24,"w"],["1Cor.13.4",23,"r"],["1Cor.13.7",23,"r"],["Prov.15.18",9,"w"],["Jas.5.20",9,"w"],["Jas.4.1",6,"r"],["Prov.16.27",5,"r"],["Prov.28.25",5,"w"],["Prov.29.22",4,"w"]]},{"n":13,"t":"In the lips of him that hath understanding wisdom is found: but a rod is for the back of him that is void of understanding.","it":[[70,72]],"x":[["Prov.26.3",7,"w"],["Prov.6.32",5,"w"],["Isa.50.4",4,"r"],["Prov.20.15",3,"w"],["Prov.15.7",3,"w"],["Prov.17.10",3,"r"],["Prov.27.22",3,"r"],["Prov.10.31",3,"w"],["Prov.15.23",3,"r"],["Prov.10.21",3,"w"]]},{"n":14,"t":"Wise men lay up knowledge: but the mouth of the foolish is near destruction.","it":[[5,8],[56,58]],"x":[["Prov.18.7",6,"w"],["Prov.10.8",5,"w"],["Prov.13.3",4,"w"],["Prov.10.10",3,"r"],["Prov.9.9",3,"w"],["Matt.12.35",2,"r"],["Matt.13.44",2,"r"],["Prov.18.15",2,"w"],["Prov.1.5",2,"w"],["Prov.18.1",2,"r"]]},{"n":15,"t":"The rich man’s wealth is his strong city: the destruction of the poor is their poverty.","it":[[22,24],[70,72]],"x":[["Prov.18.11",8,"q"],["Prov.19.7",6,"w"],["Ps.52.7",5,"r"],["Prov.14.20",4,"w"],["Prov.22.22",3,"w"],["Prov.22.23",3,"r"],["Eccl.7.12",3,"r"],["Ps.49.6",2,"w"],["Jer.9.23",2,"w"],["Job.31.24",2,"r"]]},{"n":16,"t":"The labour of the righteous tendeth to life: the fruit of the wicked to sin.","it":[[28,35]],"x":[["Isa.3.10",4,"w"],["Isa.3.11",4,"w"],["John.6.27",3,"w"],["Heb.6.10",3,"w"],["Prov.11.18",3,"w"],["Prov.11.19",3,"w"],["Rom.6.23",3,"w"],["Gal.6.7",2,"r"],["Gal.6.9",2,"r"],["Matt.12.33",2,"w"]]},{"n":17,"t":"He is in the way of life that keepeth instruction: but he that refuseth reproof erreth.","it":[[3,8]],"x":[["2Pet.1.5",12,"r"],["2Pet.1.11",12,"r"],["Prov.6.23",7,"w"],["Luke.11.28",7,"r"],["Prov.15.10",6,"w"],["Matt.7.24",5,"r"],["Matt.7.27",5,"r"],["Prov.29.1",5,"r"],["Prov.3.18",5,"r"],["Prov.5.12",5,"w"]]},{"n":18,"t":"He that hideth hatred with lying lips, and he that uttereth a slander, is a fool.","it":[[22,26],[71,73]],"x":[["Prov.26.24",5,"w"],["Prov.26.26",5,"w"],["Ps.55.21",4,"r"],["2Sam.3.27",3,"r"],["Ps.15.3",3,"r"],["2Sam.13.23",2,"r"],["2Sam.13.29",2,"r"],["Ps.101.5",2,"r"],["2Sam.11.8",2,"r"],["2Sam.11.15",2,"r"]]},{"n":19,"t":"In the multitude of words there wanteth not sin: but he that refraineth his lips is wise.","it":[[81,83]],"x":[["Jas.3.2",12,"r"],["Jas.1.19",12,"r"],["Prov.17.27",10,"r"],["Prov.17.28",10,"w"],["Eccl.10.13",9,"r"],["Eccl.10.14",9,"r"],["Ps.39.1",7,"w"],["Eccl.5.3",7,"w"]]},{"n":20,"t":"The tongue of the just is as choice silver: the heart of the wicked is little worth.","it":[[23,28],[68,70]],"x":[["Gen.6.5",3,"r"],["Prov.12.18",3,"w"],["Jer.17.9",3,"w"],["Gen.8.21",2,"r"],["Prov.16.13",2,"r"],["Prov.15.4",2,"w"],["Matt.12.34",2,"r"],["Matt.12.35",2,"r"],["Prov.8.19",2,"w"],["Prov.23.7",2,"r"]]},{"n":21,"t":"The lips of the righteous feed many: but fools die for want of wisdom.","x":[["Hos.4.6",8,"r"],["Prov.17.16",7,"w"],["Job.4.3",5,"r"],["Job.4.4",5,"r"],["Eccl.12.9",5,"r"],["Eccl.12.10",5,"r"],["Matt.13.19",5,"r"],["Prov.1.29",5,"r"],["Prov.15.4",4,"r"],["Job.29.21",3,"r"]]},{"n":22,"t":"The blessing of the LORD, it maketh rich, and he addeth no sorrow with it.","x":[["Ps.107.38",74,"r"],["Gen.26.12",57,"r"],["1Sam.2.7",52,"e"],["1Sam.2.8",52,"r"],["Gen.24.35",43,"r"],["Gen.12.2",40,"w"],["Ps.37.22",32,"r"],["Deut.8.17",31,"r"],["Deut.8.18",31,"r"],["Ps.113.7",24,"r"]]},{"n":23,"t":"It is as sport to a fool to do mischief: but a man of understanding hath wisdom.","it":[[0,5]],"x":[["Prov.15.21",7,"w"],["Prov.14.9",5,"r"],["Prov.2.14",5,"r"],["Prov.26.18",4,"r"],["Prov.26.19",4,"w"],["Eccl.11.9",3,"r"]]},{"n":24,"t":"The fear of the wicked, it shall come upon him: but the desire of the righteous shall be granted.","x":[["Ps.145.19",15,"w"],["Matt.5.6",11,"r"],["1John.5.14",10,"r"],["1John.5.15",10,"r"],["Isa.66.4",10,"r"],["Job.15.21",9,"r"],["John.14.18",8,"r"],["Ps.21.2",7,"w"],["Job.3.25",7,"r"],["Heb.10.27",7,"r"]]},{"n":25,"t":"As the whirlwind passeth, so is the wicked no more: but the righteous is an everlasting foundation.","it":[[29,31],[46,51],[70,72]],"x":[["Ps.15.5",7,"r"],["Matt.7.24",6,"r"],["Matt.7.27",6,"r"],["Ps.58.9",6,"w"],["Prov.12.3",5,"w"],["Prov.12.7",4,"w"],["Isa.40.24",4,"w"],["Matt.16.18",4,"r"],["Eph.2.20",4,"w"],["Job.21.18",4,"r"]]},{"n":26,"t":"As vinegar to the teeth, and as smoke to the eyes, so is the sluggard to them that send him.","it":[[54,56]],"x":[["Prov.26.6",3,"r"],["Prov.25.13",3,"w"],["Matt.25.26",2,"r"],["Heb.6.12",2,"r"],["Prov.25.20",2,"w"],["Isa.65.5",1,"w"],["Rom.12.11",1,"r"]]},{"n":27,"t":"The fear of the LORD prolongeth days: but the years of the wicked shall be shortened.","x":[["Prov.9.11",12,"r"],["Prov.3.2",8,"r"],["Ps.91.16",6,"r"],["Job.15.32",5,"r"],["Job.15.33",5,"r"],["Ps.34.11",4,"w"],["Ps.34.13",4,"r"],["Eccl.7.17",4,"w"],["Ps.21.4",4,"r"],["Ps.55.23",3,"r"]]},{"n":28,"t":"The hope of the righteous shall be gladness: but the expectation of the wicked shall perish.","it":[[26,34]],"x":[["Job.8.13",4,"w"],["Rom.15.13",4,"w"],["Prov.11.7",3,"e"],["Ps.73.24",3,"r"],["Ps.73.26",3,"r"],["Rom.5.2",2,"w"],["Job.11.20",2,"w"],["2Thess.2.16",2,"w"],["Prov.14.32",2,"w"],["Ps.112.10",2,"w"]]},{"n":29,"t":"The way of the LORD is strength to the upright: but destruction shall be to the workers of iniquity.","it":[[20,22],[64,72]],"x":[["Prov.21.15",9,"e"],["Phil.4.13",4,"r"],["Rom.2.8",3,"r"],["Rom.2.9",3,"r"],["Ps.37.20",3,"r"],["Zech.10.12",3,"r"],["Ps.36.12",3,"w"],["Ps.92.7",3,"w"],["Isa.40.31",3,"w"],["Ps.84.7",3,"w"]]},{"n":30,"t":"The righteous shall never be removed: but the wicked shall not inhabit the earth.","x":[["Ps.37.22",8,"r"],["Ps.125.1",7,"w"],["Ps.37.28",6,"w"],["Ps.37.29",6,"w"],["Prov.2.21",6,"r"],["Prov.2.22",6,"w"],["Ps.37.9",6,"r"],["Ps.37.10",6,"w"],["Prov.10.25",5,"w"],["Ps.16.8",4,"r"]]},{"n":31,"t":"The mouth of the just bringeth forth wisdom: but the froward tongue shall be cut out.","x":[["Ps.37.30",7,"e"],["Prov.10.13",4,"w"],["Prov.10.20",3,"w"],["Prov.10.21",3,"w"],["Ps.63.11",2,"w"],["Ps.120.3",2,"w"],["Ps.120.4",2,"r"],["Prov.10.11",2,"w"],["Ps.31.18",2,"r"]]},{"n":32,"t":"The lips of the righteous know what is acceptable: but the mouth of the wicked speaketh frowardness.","it":[[79,87]],"x":[["Prov.12.6",3,"w"],["Prov.12.18",3,"w"],["Prov.15.28",3,"e"],["Prov.2.12",3,"w"],["Prov.11.11",3,"w"],["Prov.15.2",2,"w"],["Eccl.12.10",2,"w"],["Prov.18.6",2,"w"],["Prov.18.8",2,"r"],["Dan.4.27",1,"w"]]}]}